# Per-dataset run scripts are local-only: they hardcode this lab's NAS mount
# points, usernames, and collaborator names, none of which belong in a public
# repo (and none of which are useful to anyone else). Sanitized, parameterised
# equivalents live in scripts/examples/ and ARE tracked — this pattern is
# anchored to scripts/ so it does not match scripts/examples/.
scripts/extract_*.sh

# Run logs (the example scripts write a timestamped log to the working dir).
*.log
